@startuml
' A state's style in one word: its fill first, then its border's color
' (`line:`), dash or weight (`line.dashed`, `line.dotted`, `line.bold`)
' and the color of its name (`text:`); `##[bold]` is a bold border in
' the border's own color.
state Idle : waits
state Failed #pink;line:red;line.bold;text:red : gave up
state Retrying #palegreen;line:green;line.dashed;text:green : tries again
state Paused #line.dotted;line:blue;text:blue : held
state Done ##[bold]
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Retrying : error
Retrying --> Failed : again
Retrying --> Paused : pause
Paused --> Done
@enduml
